 "title": "We Gather Together",
 "description": "Theodore Baker's English of an old Dutch hymn of thanksgiving, sung to the Netherlands tune Kremser in the four parts The Beacon Hymnal printed in 1924, for 2 to 4 singers: two verses, steady and strong in three.",
 "language": "en",
